  "description": "SimpleJson-Unity.cs 是一个AOT编译友好的轻量级JSON序列化/反序列化库，基于SimpleJson项目改进而来，特别针对Unity的AOT（Ahead-Of-Time）编译环境进行了优化。\nSimpleJson-Unity.cs is a lightweight JSON serialization/deserialization library friendly to AOT compilation. It is improved based on the SimpleJson project and specially optimized for Unity's AOT (Ahead-Of-Time) compilation environment.",
